Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:53:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat: handle tel: and sms: links

- Register tel and sms protocols so Sefirah can be picked as the
  Windows default app for phone and SMS links
- ExternalLinkParser: tel:/sms: with comma-separated recipients and
  body=, percent-decoded once ('+' kept), numbers cleaned with
  CleanDialInput; sefirah:// keeps its scrcpy handler
- Links prefill the dialer or a new SMS draft and switch to that page
  (also in narrow layout); nothing is dialed or sent automatically
- Links arriving during cold start are applied once MainPage loads
- Guard contact lookup when no device is active

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
